{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"cca9f1916ec76558f60e63a94c27b4ff5971c1ece83de021d94744e853f7a9c1","ja":"お疲れっ！　今日の紬の声、すっごく響いてたね♪\nアタシも一緒に歌えて気持ちよかったよ！","zh":"辛苦啦！今天紬的声音真的很响亮呢♪\n我也和你一起唱得好尽兴哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0729bad07e13f86fbeefdebab4513442210bb20b91920d3495195c8653e18090","ja":"ありがとうございます。私こそ、福田さんには\nたくさんリードしていただいて、助かりました。","zh":"谢谢您。我也多亏福田小姐\n处处带动着我，真是帮了大忙。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6ec289da52f79c56080f32ceb0d1106a5a1540510c64f88f581e6dc5a9e08152","ja":"特に最後のMCは……。気の利いたことを言わないとと\n思い、言葉に詰まってしまって……。","zh":"特别是最后的串场主持……想着必须说点\n得体机灵的话，结果反倒语塞了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0ec0c593995387eee8a489dfc5be994a3d4d048c5c36db87a4b4daa907faa33e","ja":"わかる！　そういうときってあるよね。でも他の人が\nフォローできるから、全然気にすることないよ！","zh":"我懂！有时确实会这样呢。不过其他人\n能够从旁协助，所以完全不用放在心上哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"22de14974f9bdec045dfde25f43c7e67c0ee1c40497b0cb31c169eab775c81e3","ja":"そう言っていただけるのは嬉しいのですが……\nやはり、私自身も精進する必要があるかと。","zh":"承蒙您这么说我固然很高兴，但是……\n果然，我自己也仍需继续精进。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"666e71d6e8ec63e9b00e355f4994c7cef89638ba718be63a022ed96b71444bf7","ja":"いかなるときも、即座に言葉を発する……。\nとっさの判断力と度胸を身につけなければ！","zh":"无论何时，都要能立刻开口接话……\n必须掌握临场的判断力和胆识才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"225e6338376c0a6406ba8ef98ff93ea0ebcb2839cf7d5ddd4d5a155712fae4e7","ja":"とっさの判断力と度胸か……あ！\nそれならさ、プロレスなんてどう？","zh":"临场应变能力和胆量吗……啊！\n既然这样，职业摔角怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"fafdfb5d23ba35a12fcca6474a0e6909cdf4602f0fc5ed67911e99a654c3fcf0","ja":"えっ！？　ぷ、プロレスですか。","zh":"诶！？摔、摔角吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"49f5138e38fe619d24b1a4e5295f2617cc015b1a9900d1ced257a6ee18c6590e","ja":"とっさの判断力も度胸も必要だし、\nマイクパフォーマンスも参考になると思うよ。","zh":"不仅需要临机应变的能力和胆量，\n麦克风控场表现也很有参考价值哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"70d07d7411b0466838e4ca42c4250f7e28533c33b9b1954cffbe4f5c66e62426","ja":"オススメの動画があるから一緒に観よっ♪","zh":"我有推荐的视频，一起看嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1050.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"bc6b55006d7d35925d582f402864ef9126f6b7432719d79aca651c4b2859d1a3","ja":"わ、分かりました。\nよろしくお願いします。","zh":"我、我知道了。\n请多指教。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
